WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Check scope, days and cutoff
Confirm global or selected-store scope. Counts are child orders, not
customers. Check the saved UTC observation cutoff.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Keep cancellation populations separate
Placed-order cancellations differ from events during the period.
Lifecycle is observed at cutoff; who initiated cancellation does not
establish fault.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Read whole-order dispatch and samples
A label or one parcel is not whole-order dispatch. Durations use
supported samples and nearest-rank percentiles; missing timing is
unavailable, not zero.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check accepted commitments and coverage
Due commitments use original accepted deadlines, a separate population.
First-party orders can be unmonitored. Incomplete evidence does not
prove a breach.
